# moment kind=crossing hero=dave capAt=.4
Your first Hà Nội street crossing.
*Walk slowly.* Don't stop. They flow around you.

# moment kind=mapdive to=hagiang label="HÀ GIANG" time=sunset trans=fgwipe
Then go north, to the mountains.

# moment kind=pass hero=dave time=sunset trans=fade
The Hà Giang loop at golden hour.
Ride with a local driver if you're not confident on hairpins.

# talk place=oldquarter host=linh mood=happy fg=wires+bokeh cam=breathe shots="MS linh|MCU linh low"
Back in the city, eat on the street.
Bún chả is a lunch dish. Go before two.

# moment kind=steam dish=buncha
Grilled pork, cold noodles, a mountain of herbs.

# moment kind=downpour place=oldquarter trans=glitch
And when the afternoon storm hits, it hits fast.
Fifteen minutes later, the street is dry again.

# moment kind=cave hero=kenji guide=co_lan
In Ninh Bình, a rowing boat slides through the caves.

# dialogue a=dave b=co_lan place=hoian time=night fg=lanterns lines="a:starstruck:Is it okay to light one?|b:happy:Of course. Make a wish first.|a:love:Done. Now what?|b:joy:Now let the river take it."

# moment kind=lanterns
And in Hội An, the river carries your wish downstream.

